  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.1.0: New Explain access (why can this user do this?), What can a user do? (every table against the eight privileges, in the style of the Dynamics 365 security role editor) and Privileged users (roles that can delete across the organization and who holds them). 1.0.1: Packaging update only, no functional changes. 1.0.0: First release. Explore: users and teams, team members, users by role, users by business unit, privilege finder, compare users and a cleanup report. Change: assign roles to users and to teams, manage team membership and clone a user profile; every change is reviewed before it is applied and can be undone.",
